-
----
- .../bindings/remoteproc/renesas,rz-rproc.yaml | 136 ++++++++++++++++++
- 1 file changed, 136 insertions(+)
- create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/renesas,rz-rproc.yaml
