-From 9b1cd012589887f17dbb5cd44a6b2386b823095a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
-From: Nguyen Thanh Tam <tam.nguyen.wr@renesas.com>
-Date: Wed, 3 Dec 2025 18:08:48 +0700
-Subject: [PATCH] Add-RZ-remoteproc-driver
-
